{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discard</strong> - it is a sci-fi puzzle 2D-platformer inspired by old-school cinematic platformers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must solve problems in order to survive on this dangerous planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/01313087a117ade204b2ffcdb46ac4e4.poster.avif?t=1759076803\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/01313087a117ade204b2ffcdb46ac4e4.webm?t=1759076803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/01313087a117ade204b2ffcdb46ac4e4.mp4?t=1759076803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Discover new areas to explore and secrets to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Solve puzzles to escape. One wrong move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/0148248c0c24ec4c9aa505911440dbd4.poster.avif?t=1759076803\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/0148248c0c24ec4c9aa505911440dbd4.webm?t=1759076803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590480/extras/0148248c0c24ec4c9aa505911440dbd4.mp4?t=1759076803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 A World Alive with Danger: Explore diverse zones, from underground labs to deser